  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A photograph of a Toronto avenue with glass condo towers, where the traffic has been redrawn as rounded cartoon cars and the street lamps outlined, signed 2023.",
    "description": "A portrait format digital piece on a photograph, signed 2023 at lower left. Two tall glass condo towers with balconies rise at the top against a pale sky, with pink outlined bands drawn across their rooftops. Below, a low rise shopping street with shop signs, trees outlined in green, and street lamps redrawn in black outline with bell shaped heads. The lower half is a traffic jam of cars redrawn as soft rounded cartoon shapes in white, grey, pale blue and pink with black outlines, filling the road toward the viewer; the nearest is a pale blue car with a large rear window. A white outlined lampshade shape floats at left.",
    "impression": "Toronto from the middle of the road, with the cars gone soft and friendly as if they were drawn by a child in the back seat. The towers keep their glass and the cars lose theirs. It is the traffic jam of About Town 7 twelve years later, now with a photograph underneath.",
